# Debuggable builds (userdebug): run adbd as root from the start of boot, so the logs
# of a boot that hangs or loops can be read with adb. A dirty flash keeps the
# USB setting of the user build before it, which may have ADB off. User builds
# aren't debuggable and skip this.
on property:ro.debuggable=1
    setprop persist.sys.usb.config adb
    # Start adbd as root, as after "adb root"
    setprop service.adb.root 1
